      "wikidata": "Q17621125",
      "summary": {
        "text": "Alex Guenette (born April 25, 1996) is a Canadian professional stock car racing driver. He last competed part-time in the NASCAR Canada Series, driving the No. 39 for JASS Racing with XEMIS Racing, and part-time in the NASCAR O'Reilly Auto Parts Series, driving the No. 92 Chevrolet Camaro SS for DGM Racing with Jesse Iwuji Motorsports. He has also competed in other series, most notably the NASCAR Camping World Truck Series and ARCA Racing Series.",
